308
00:18:04,548 --> 00:18:07,803
The focus style fails in two ways

309
00:18:08,928 --> 00:18:10,358
outline: none plus box-shadow.

310
00:18:10,358 --> 00:18:13,934
In forced-colors mode (Windows contrast themes) the browser removes box-shadow,

311
00:18:13,934 --> 00:18:17,153
so keyboard users see no focus indicator at all.

312
00:18:17,153 --> 00:18:20,729
An outline survives forced colors because the browser repaints it

313
00:18:20,729 --> 00:18:23,947
in a system colour. - :focus instead of :focus-visible.

314
00:18:23,947 --> 00:18:26,451
The ring appears on every mouse click,

315
00:18:26,451 --> 00:18:30,384
which is why teams are tempted to remove it. :focus-visible shows

316
00:18:30,384 --> 00:18:33,603
it when the browser judges a focus indicator useful,

317
00:18:33,603 --> 00:18:35,033
such as keyboard navigation.

318
00:18:35,033 --> 00:18:39,325
The 40%-opacity ring is also unlikely to meet the 3:1 contrast required

319
00:18:39,325 --> 00:18:43,259
for focus indicators against both the button and the page background.

