336
00:19:50,643 --> 00:19:55,250
Ask whether the request represents a recurring supported role or a one-page exception.

337
00:19:55,250 --> 00:19:59,503
A reusable action variant deserves a named semantic contract and state rules.

338
00:19:59,503 --> 00:20:02,692
A supported component customization may justify a component token.

339
00:20:02,692 --> 00:20:05,528
A purely local art-direction choice can remain an

340
00:20:05,528 --> 00:20:08,008
