341
00:20:08,008 --> 00:20:12,616
Check foreground contrast, hover, disabled, and focus states before approving any lighter background.

342
00:20:12,616 --> 00:20:15,805
Avoid a variant named only after its current shade

343
00:20:15,805 --> 00:20:18,640
because that meaning will not survive another theme.

344
