Use an allowlist for deliberate values such as transparent

348
00:20:42,484 --> 00:20:45,428
and system colors, and require review for exceptions.

349
00:20:45,428 --> 00:20:49,109
Validate generated token references, run theme previews and contrast checks,

350
00:20:49,109 --> 00:20:52,421
and teach the role-based naming model in contribution guidance.

351
00:20:52,421 --> 00:20:56,469
A rule that blindly forbids every hexadecimal value even in the

352
00:20:56,469 --> 00:21:00,517
