391
00:23:22,874 --> 00:23:24,197
TOK-002 · 1.

392
00:23:24,197 --> 00:23:26,844
The old name silently stops working

393
00:23:27,969 --> 00:23:31,868
Every product team that sets --ui-button-bg now gets the default colour.

394
00:23:31,868 --> 00:23:35,412
CSS does not fail: an unused custom property is valid,

395
00:23:35,412 --> 00:23:39,311
nothing is logged, and no build or type check catches it.

396
00:23:39,311 --> 00:23:43,565
The documented token was public API, so removing it requires a major

397
00:23:43,565 --> 00:23:47,819
release, and should come after a deprecation period, not in a minor.

398
00:23:49,194 --> 00:23:50,814
TOK-002 · 2.

399
00:23:50,814 --> 00:23:55,137
Declaring the token on :host blocks consumer overrides

400
00:23:56,262 --> 00:24:00,708
With emulated encapsulation, :host compiles to an attribute selector such

401
00:24:00,708 --> 00:24:04,709
as [_nghost-abc], with the specificity of a class (0,1,0).

402
00:24:04,709 --> 00:24:05,599
Two consequences:

403
00:24:06,974 --> 00:24:08,581
TOK-002 · 2.

404
00:24:08,581 --> 00:24:12,869
Declaring the token on :host blocks consumer overrides

405
00:24:13,994 --> 00:24:18,359
Inheritance is cut off. .checkout ui-button { --ui-button-background: ... } is

406
00:24:18,359 --> 00:24:22,724
fine, but a team that sets the token on an ancestor

407
00:24:22,724 --> 00:24:25,899
