408
00:24:25,899 --> 00:24:29,470
and the host element now declares its own value,

409
00:24:29,470 --> 00:24:31,454
which wins over anything inherited.

410
00:24:31,454 --> 00:24:33,835
Theming a whole region stops working.

411
00:24:33,835 --> 00:24:37,407
Element selectors lose. ui-button { --ui-button-background: red; } has

412
00:24:37,407 --> 00:24:40,582
specificity (0,0,1) and loses to the :host rule.

413
00:24:40,582 --> 00:24:44,550
Consumers must out-specify the library, and the library's stylesheet is

414
00:24:44,550 --> 00:24:48,518
usually inserted after the application's, so equal specificity also loses.

415
00:24:49,894 --> 00:24:51,084
TOK-002 · 2.

416
00:24:51,084 --> 00:24:54,259
Declaring the token on :host blocks consumer overrides

417
00:24:55,384 --> 00:24:57,877
So even teams that migrate to the new

418
00:24:57,877 --> 00:25:00,059
name find it does not work reliably.

419
00:25:01,434 --> 00:25:02,665
