530
00:32:04,992 --> 00:32:09,688
TOK-003 · Report 1: global browser objects crash server rendering

531
00:32:10,813 --> 00:32:14,193
window and document do not exist during server-side rendering,

532
00:32:14,193 --> 00:32:18,326
so window.matchMedia throws a ReferenceError as soon as the service is

533
00:32:18,326 --> 00:32:18,701
created.

534
00:32:18,701 --> 00:32:23,585
Because the service is providedIn: 'root' and injected early, the whole application fails.

535
00:32:23,585 --> 00:32:27,342
A library cannot assume it only runs in a browser.

536
00:32:28,717 --> 00:32:34,665
TOK-003 · Report 1: global browser objects crash server rendering

537
00:32:35,790 --> 00:32:40,822
Fix: inject DOCUMENT, and do not read browser-only APIs during construction.

538
00:32:42,197 --> 00:32:46,571
TOK-003 · Report 2: the flash, and the lost classes

539
00:32:47,696 --> 00:32:48,398
The flash.

540
00:32:48,398 --> 00:32:52,615
No theme applies until JavaScript has loaded, bootstrapped, and run the effect.

541
00:32:52,615 --> 00:32:55,426
Until then the page has no theme class,

542
00:32:55,426 --> 00:32:57,886
so the light defaults show, then switch.

543
00:32:57,886 --> 00:33:01,752
Users with a dark system preference see this on every load.

544
00:33:01,752 --> 00:33:06,671
Lost classes. document.body.className = ... replaces every class on body, including the application's own.

545
00:33:06,671 --> 00:33:08,077
It also goes stale.

546
00:33:08,077 --> 00:33:10,185
The OS preference is read once.

547
00:33:10,185 --> 00:33:15,105
If the user's system switches to dark at sunset, the page does not follow.

548
00:33:15,105 --> 00:33:19,322
There is also no way to say "follow the system" after toggling.

549
00:33:20,697 --> 00:33:25,507
TOK-003 · Report 2: the flash, and the lost classes

550
00:33:26,632 --> 00:33:29,567
Fix: let CSS handle the system preference,

551
00:33:29,567 --> 00:33:32,922
and use JavaScript only for an explicit choice.

