686
00:42:30,315 --> 00:42:34,920
WCAG 1.4.12 (Text Spacing) requires that no content is lost when

687
00:42:34,920 --> 00:42:39,526
users increase line height, letter spacing, word spacing and paragraph spacing.

688
00:42:39,526 --> 00:42:44,970
1.4.4 (Resize Text) requires text to scale to 200% without loss of content.

689
00:42:44,970 --> 00:42:48,738
A fixed height with overflow: hidden and nowrap guarantees

690
00:42:48,738 --> 00:42:52,507
